{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' answer/final_closeout_summary.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Final Closeout Summary\n\nThe correct reimbursement cap for this closeout is `$1,600.00`, based on `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`. That update controls because `01_allowability_rules.md` directs use of the newest dated award document when award documents conflict, and the 2026-05-22 update supersedes the 2026-04-15 original `$2,000.00` award letter.\n\nThe corrected reimbursable total is `$1,588.00`, leaving `$12.00` remaining under the cap. This total preserves the prior analyst's supported decisions to approve `G-001` garden supplies and `G-003` accessibility printing, and to reject `G-004` staff gifts. It also preserves the previously captured outcome facts that 140 seedling starter kits were distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed.\n\nThe packet corrects the parts of the prior work that were no longer supportable under the current evidence. `G-002` was reduced from `$145.00` to `$120.00` because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00`. `G-005` was changed from approved to rejected because the `$310.00` expense exceeds the `$75.00` receipt threshold and no receipt is on file. The omitted `G-006` final report postage expense was added and approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible and the amount is within the no-receipt threshold with a ledger note.\n\nOutcome facts from `05_outcomes.md` for the manager's record:\n\n- 140 seedling starter kits were distributed.\n- 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n- 18 volunteer setup shifts were completed.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' answer/audit_findings.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve From Prior Work\n\n- `G-001` should remain approved at `$980.00`. The prior draft correctly treated garden supplies as eligible. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`.\n- `G-003` should remain approved at `$420.00`. The prior draft correctly treated accessibility printing as eligible. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`.\n- `G-004` should remain rejected at `$0.00`. The prior draft correctly treated staff gifts as ineligible. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`.\n- The outcome facts that 140 seedling starter kits were distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed should be preserved from the draft summary because they match the outcome note. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`, `05_outcomes.md`.\n\n## Correct Prior Work\n\n- The prior draft used the wrong award cap. The controlling cap is `$1,600.00`, not `$2,000.00`. The newer dated award document controls under the rules. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`, `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`.\n- `G-002` should be corrected from full approval of `$145.00` to partial approval of `$120.00` because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00` for this event. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`.\n- `G-005` should be corrected from approval of `$310.00` to rejection at `$0.00`. The prior note relied on project relevance, but the current rules require a receipt for any single expense over `$75.00`, and this expense has no receipt on file. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`.\n- The prior draft reimbursement total of `$1,855.00` should be corrected because it used the stale cap context, over-approved refreshments, approved an expense lacking the required receipt, and omitted one expense entry. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`.\n\n## Omitted Expense\n\n- `G-006` Final report postage was omitted from the prior draft. It should be included as an approved expense at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible and expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`.\n\n## Controlling Award Cap Source\n\n- The controlling award cap source is `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`.\n- Reason: `01_allowability_rules.md` says to use the newest dated award document when award documents conflict, and the 2026-05-22 update expressly supersedes the 2026-04-15 original letter for closeout purposes.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
